@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #475569
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
}

actor "Deploy client" as Client #D7EAF8
participant "HTTP / gRPC" as API #BEE5CF
participant "Queue sender" as Sender #FFF0A8
participant "Detached proposer\nworker" as Worker #F7C7C7
participant "NodeRuntime\ncritical wrapper" as Runtime #E3D8F5

== Initially healthy ==
Client -> API: submit deploy
API -> Sender: trigger proposal
Sender -> Worker: queue request
Worker --> Sender: proposal result
Sender --> API: accepted

== Invisible critical loss ==
Worker -[#B91C1C]> Worker: panic, error, or return
destroy Worker
Runtime -> Runtime: result stream closes
note right of Runtime #FFE0B2
  Wrapper returns Ok(())
  Runtime warns but keeps APIs alive
end note

== Zombie validator ==
Client -> API: status
API --> Client: HTTP 200, isReady=true
Client -> API: submit deploy
API -> Sender: trigger proposal
Sender -[#B91C1C]> Sender: channel closed
Sender --> API: internal failure
API --> Client: deploy cannot finalize
@enduml
